      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}\n\nYes, It's not super well documented but after a while of research and finding the VRC.OSCQuery library it does fill my needs.\n\nhttps://github.com/vrchat-community/vrc-oscquery-lib/blob/main/getting-started.md\n\nThanks!",
