  "created": "2025-08-12T09:52:45.783Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As a developer who uses OSC alot in their projects, allowing OSC programs to request VRChat to send data to it's own custom port would be a dream, allowing multiple OSC applications to run without the need for an OSC Router.\n\nFor example, exposing a feature that can be called on the default port that requests for VRChat OSC to open a new port on the requested port. This could allow multiple OSC applications to run on different ports but all interact with VRChat. So requesting on port 9000 to open a port on 1524 for example, and then the application could perform all it's functions on that port.\n\nThanks!",
